{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24271","headline":"白羽扇 · 白居易","name":"白羽扇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"素是自然色，圆因裁制功。\n飒如松起籁，飘似鹤翻空。\n盛夏不销雪，终年无尽风。\n引秋生手里，藏月入怀中。\n麈尾斑非疋，蒲葵陋不同。\n何人称相对，清瘦白须翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24271.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24271","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}